---
// Bism Supported Living — landing page (initial 1:1 port from mockup)
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#7d8a5e">
  <title>Bism Supported Living · SLS & ILS in Los Angeles County · California Regional Center vendor</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Bism Supported Living, LLC is a California Regional Center vendored provider of Supported Living Services (SLS) and Independent Living Services (ILS) for neurodivergent adults across Los Angeles County. Vendored with FDLRC (#PD4210); open to clients of any California Regional Center. Person-centered, trauma-informed support — paced to the people we serve. English, Spanish, Vietnamese.">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://bismliving.com/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://bismliving.com/es/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="vi" href="https://bismliving.com/vi/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://bismliving.com/">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://bismliving.com/">
  <meta name="author" content="Bism LLC">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://bismliving.com/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Bism Supported Living · SLS & ILS in Los Angeles County">
  <meta property="og:description" content="California Regional Center vendored provider of Supported and Independent Living Services for neurodivergent adults in LA County.">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Bism Supported Living · SLS & ILS in Los Angeles County">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="California Regional Center vendored provider of Supported and Independent Living Services for neurodivergent adults in LA County.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* ---------- Direction D · Storybook palette ---------- */
    :root {
      --bg:        #f7f1e3;
      --paper:     #fdf9ee;
      --surface:   #ead9b6;
      --deep:      #2d2820;   /* dark band — D's ink */
      --ink:       #2d2820;
      --soft-ink:  #5a5040;
      --accent:    #7d8a5e;
      --accent-deep: #5d6a44;
      --accent-soft: #a8b48a;  /* lightened from D accent for dark-bg use */
      --warm:      #c47a4f;
      --pink:      #d4a190;
      --border:    #d8c8a8;
      --border-soft: #e6dcc0;

      --display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      --body:    'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
      --mono:    'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    a { color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }

    .wrap { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }

    /* ---------- Header ---------- */
    .nav {
      padding: 28px 80px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .nav__logo img { height: 90px; width: auto; }
    /* Contained pill — never bleeds past its own box, so it cannot collide
       with the CTA or language toggle when translated labels run longer. */
    .nav__logo, .nav__right { flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav__links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
      min-width: 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      padding: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--paper);
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .nav__links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav__links a:hover { background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); }
    .nav__right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    /* ---------- Language toggle ---------- */
    .nav__lang {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
      padding: 3px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--paper);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .nav__lang a {
      display: block;
      padding: 5px 13px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav__lang a:hover { color: var(--ink); background: var(--surface); }
    .nav__lang a[aria-current="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
    .nav__cta {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--bg);
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    /* ---------- Eyebrow ---------- */
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .eyebrow--bar {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    }
    .eyebrow--bar::before {
      content: ""; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: currentColor;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    section { padding: 120px 80px; }

    /* ---------- HERO (Direction A copy) ---------- */
    .hero {
      padding: 100px 80px 80px;
    }
    .hero__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 77px;
      line-height: 1.05;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .hero__lead {
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-top: 36px;
      max-width: 560px;
      color: var(--ink);
      opacity: 0.78;
    }
    .hero__ctas {
      display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 44px;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 18px 32px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn--solid {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }
    .btn--ghost {
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .hero__partners {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 64px;
      padding-top: 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .hero__photo {
      position: relative;
    }
    .photo {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,
          var(--surface) 0 12px,
          var(--border) 12px 24px);
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 16px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .photo--sage { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #c9d2b8 0 12px, #bcc7a7 12px 24px); }
    .photo--warm { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #e8dfd1 0 12px, #ddd1be 12px 24px); }
    .photo--clay { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #d4b69b 0 12px, #c8a98c 12px 24px); }
    .photo--deep { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #3a3a35 0 12px, #33332e 12px 24px); color: #aea696; }

    /* Scroll-synced video — overrides .photo placeholder visuals */
    .photo--video {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 0;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .hero__photo-video { aspect-ratio: 812 / 1200; height: auto; }
    .careers__photo.photo--video {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 520px;
    }
    .areas__map-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .hero__pull {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -40px;
      left: -40px;
      width: 240px;
      background: var(--paper);
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -28px rgba(45, 40, 32, 0.18);
    }
    .hero__pull img { height: 36px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .hero__pull-quote {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .hero__pull-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* ---------- SLS / ILS split (B) ---------- */
    .split {
      padding: 0;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--bg);
    }
    .split__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .split__col {
      padding: 120px 56px;
    }
    .split__col + .split__col {
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(247, 241, 227, 0.22);
    }
    .split__label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.75;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .split h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 64px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--bg);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .split p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.72;
      max-width: 440px;
    }
    .split ul {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .split li {
      padding-left: 24px;
      position: relative;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.88;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .split li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0; top: 11px;
      width: 12px; height: 1px;
      background: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    /* ---------- Approach manifesto (B) ---------- */
    .approach {
      padding: 160px 80px;
    }
    .approach__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.6fr 1.6fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .approach__side {
      position: sticky; top: 40px;
    }
    .approach h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 84px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 0.98;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      max-width: 900px;
    }
    .approach h2 em {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .approach__lead {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: var(--ink);
      opacity: 0.78;
      max-width: 720px;
    }
    .approach__points {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 80px;
    }
    .approach__point {
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .approach__point h3 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .approach__point p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--ink);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    /* Floating sticky hearts.
       Two heart zones wrap content vertically:
         heart-zone--top    wraps hero + split, hero-pull heart sticks here
         heart-zone--bottom wraps approach + all following sections, approach heart sticks here
       Each zone has an absolutely-positioned anchor that defines the horizontal
       position; the heart inside is position:sticky so it pins to the viewport
       top offset while its zone is in view, then releases when the zone ends. */
    .heart-zone { position: relative; }
    .heart-zone__anchor {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 5;
    }
    .heart-zone__anchor--left {
      left: 80px;
      width: 56px;
    }
    .floating-heart {
      position: sticky;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      opacity: 0.85;
      transition: filter 0.35s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
      will-change: transform, filter, opacity;
    }
    /* Approach heart starts under the "Our Approach" eyebrow */
    .heart-zone__anchor--left .floating-heart {
      margin-top: 220px;
      top: 100px;
    }
    /* Applied by JS once the heart is close to alignment with the CTA white heart */
    .floating-heart--white {
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
    }
    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .heart-zone__anchor { display: none; }
    }

    /* ---------- Who we serve (B) ---------- */
    .serve {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 140px 80px;
    }
    .serve__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .serve h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .serve p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-top: 28px;
      opacity: 0.75;
      max-width: 420px;
    }
    .serve__row {
      padding: 28px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr auto;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .serve__row:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .serve__row-num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }
    .serve__row-text {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .serve__row-arrow {
      font-size: 22px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* ---------- Service Areas (B) ---------- */
    .areas {
      padding: 140px 80px;
    }
    .areas__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .areas__map {
      background: var(--paper);
      padding: 56px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .areas__map-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .areas h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 52px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0 0 32px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .areas__list { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
    .areas__cities {
      margin-top: 34px;
      padding-top: 26px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      max-width: 460px;
    }
    .areas__cities-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .areas__cities p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
    }
    .areas__row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .areas__row-name {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .areas__row-abbr {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    /* ---------- Testimonials (B) ---------- */
    .quotes {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--bg);
      padding: 160px 80px;
    }
    .quotes__label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.75;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .quotes blockquote {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 72px;
      line-height: 1.08;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--bg);
      max-width: 1200px;
    }
    .quotes blockquote em {
      color: var(--paper);
      font-style: italic;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }
    .quotes__attrib {
      margin-top: 48px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.6;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .quotes__small {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 100px;
      padding-top: 60px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 241, 227, 0.30);
    }
    .quotes__small p {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }
    .quotes__small-name {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.75;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ---------- Careers (B) ---------- */
    .careers {
      padding: 140px 80px;
    }
    .careers__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .careers__photo { height: 100%; min-height: 520px; aspect-ratio: auto; }
    .careers h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 64px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .careers__lead {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 44px;
      opacity: 0.78;
      max-width: 480px;
    }
    .btn--accent {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 18px 32px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* ---------- Resources (B) ---------- */
    .resources {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 140px 80px;
    }
    .resources__head { margin-bottom: 64px; }
    .resources h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 64px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .resources__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .resources__card {
      background: var(--paper);
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      min-height: 240px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .resources__card-tag {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .resources__card-title {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .resources__card-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .resources__card-cta {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    /* ---------- FAQ (B) ---------- */
    .faq {
      padding: 140px 80px;
    }
    .faq__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .faq h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .faq__lead {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 360px;
    }
    .faq__item {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .faq__list .faq__item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .faq__q {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .faq__plus {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 200;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .faq__item[open] .faq__plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }
    .faq__a {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      opacity: 0.78;
      max-width: 640px;
    }

    /* ---------- CTA (B) ---------- */
    .cta {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--bg);
      padding: 160px 80px;
    }
    .cta__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: end;
    }
    .cta img {
      height: 64px;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
    }
    .cta h2 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 116px;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 0.96;
      margin: 32px 0 0;
      color: var(--bg);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }
    .cta__lead {
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bg);
      opacity: 0.88;
      margin: 0 0 36px;
    }
    .cta__actions { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .cta .btn--solid {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 20px 32px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      border: none;
    }
    .cta .btn--ghost {
      border: 1px solid var(--bg);
      color: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 20px 32px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
    footer {
      padding: 48px 80px;
      background: var(--deep);
      color: var(--bg);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.10em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    footer .footer__col { opacity: 0.78; }
    footer .footer__col--mid { text-align: center; }
    footer .footer__col--right { text-align: right; }
    footer a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.3); }

    /* ---------- Visually hidden (for SR / LLM crawler content) ---------- */
    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px; height: 1px;
      padding: 0; margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }

    /* ---------- Modals ---------- */
    dialog.modal {
      border: none;
      padding: 0;
      background: transparent;
      max-width: 680px;
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      margin: auto;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    dialog.modal::backdrop {
      background: rgba(45, 40, 32, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    }
    .modal__panel {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 52px 56px 48px;
      position: relative;
      font-family: var(--body);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -40px rgba(45, 40, 32, 0.45);
    }
    .modal__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px; right: 18px;
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .modal__close:hover { background: var(--bg); }
    .modal__eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .modal__title {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .modal__sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }
    .modal__body p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .modal__body h4 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 24px 0 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    }
    .modal__body ul {
      padding-left: 18px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
    .modal__body li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* Form */
    .modal__form { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
    .modal__form label {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
    }
    .modal__form input,
    .modal__form textarea {
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .modal__form input:focus,
    .modal__form textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .modal__form textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 130px;
    }
    .modal__form-submit {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--bg);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: max-content;
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-family: var(--body);
      transition: opacity 0.15s;
    }
    .modal__form-submit:disabled {
      opacity: 0.55;
      cursor: progress;
    }
    /* Honeypot — visually hidden, kept focusable-off so bots auto-fill but humans don't see it */
    .modal__form-honeypot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .modal__form-error {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--warm);
      background: rgba(196, 122, 79, 0.10);
      border: 1px solid rgba(196, 122, 79, 0.45);
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .modal__form-error a {
      color: var(--warm);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .modal__thanks {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .modal__thanks h3 {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .modal__thanks p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--soft-ink);
    }

    /* Phones: the 3-language pill no longer fits beside the logo, so let the
       header wrap — logo on top, CTA + language toggle right-aligned beneath. */
    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .nav { flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 14px; }
      .nav__logo { flex: 1 1 100%; }
      .nav__right { margin-left: auto; align-items: flex-end; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .modal__panel { padding: 36px 28px 32px; }
      /* Display type has to come down or a single long word (e.g. the CTA's
         "conversation.") is physically wider than a phone screen. */
      .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
      .approach h2 { font-size: 40px; }
      .quotes blockquote { font-size: 30px; }
      .cta h2 { font-size: 42px; }
      .split__col h2 { font-size: 36px; }
      /* 1fr refuses to go below its longest word, shoving the arrow off-screen;
         minmax(0,1fr) lets the text column actually shrink. */
      .serve__row { grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 14px; padding: 20px 0; }
      .serve__row-text { font-size: 22px; }
      h1, h2, h3, h4, p, blockquote, li { overflow-wrap: break-word; }
      .split__col { padding: 80px 32px; }
      footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
      footer .footer__col--mid, footer .footer__col--right { text-align: left; }
      .nav__logo img { height: 64px; }
      .nav__lang { font-size: 11px; }
      .nav__lang a { padding: 5px 9px; }
      .modal__title { font-size: 28px; }
    }

    /* Hide the nav pill once its labels no longer fit beside the logo and CTA.
       Threshold is per-language: measured min width is en 1111 / es 1202 / vi 1152. */
    @media (max-width: 1140px) {
      .nav__links { display: none; }
    }

    /* ---------- Responsive (light pass) ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      /* section[class] is needed to outrank the per-section class rules
         (.serve/.areas/.quotes/.careers/.resources/.faq/.approach each set
         `padding: Npx 80px`, which beats a bare `section` selector).
         .nav and footer are not sections, so they are named too. */
      .hero, section, section[class], .nav, .cta, footer {
        padding-left: 32px; padding-right: 32px;
      }
      /* grid/flex children default to min-width:auto and refuse to shrink
         below their longest word — which pushed the page wider than the screen. */
      .split__col, .serve__row, .areas__row, .faq__item, .resources__card { min-width: 0; }
      .hero__grid > *, .approach__grid > *, .serve__grid > *, .areas__grid > *,
      .careers__grid > *, .faq__grid > *, .cta__grid > *, .split__grid > *,
      .resources__grid > * { min-width: 0; }
      .hero__grid, .approach__grid, .serve__grid, .areas__grid,
      .careers__grid, .faq__grid, .cta__grid, .split__grid,
      .resources__grid, .quotes__small, .approach__points,
      .careers__stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
      }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 52px; }
      .approach h2 { font-size: 56px; }
      .quotes blockquote { font-size: 44px; }
      .cta h2 { font-size: 72px; }
      .hero__pull { position: static; width: auto; margin-top: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ===================== NAV ===================== -->
    <header class="nav">
      <div class="nav__logo">
        <a href="/"><img src="/logo/bism-no-subtext.png" alt="Bism" /></a>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav__links">
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#approach">Our Approach</a>
        <a href="#areas">Service Areas</a>
        <a href="#careers">Careers</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav__right">
        <a class="nav__cta" href="#cta" data-modal="modal-request">Request services →</a>
        <div class="nav__lang" role="group" aria-label="Language">
          <a href="/" hreflang="en" lang="en" aria-current="true">English</a>
          <a href="/es/" hreflang="es" lang="es">Español</a>
          <a href="/vi/" hreflang="vi" lang="vi">Tiếng Việt</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ===================== HERO (Direction A copy) ===================== -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Supported &amp; Independent Living · Los Angeles County</div>
          <h1>
            Welcome to<br>
            your next chapter.<br>
            <em>Let's write it</em> together.
          </h1>
          <p class="hero__lead">
            Bism Supported Living, LLC partners with neurodivergent adults across LA County to build lives shaped by their own goals, routines, and relationships — supported with care that listens first.
          </p>
          <div class="hero__ctas">
            <a class="btn btn--solid" href="#testimonials">Testimonials</a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#services">What is SLS / ILS?</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__partners">
            <span>California Regional Center vendor · Serving adults across LA County</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__photo">
          <video class="photo photo--video hero__photo-video"
                 data-scroll-video
                 preload="auto" muted playsinline
                 disablepictureinpicture
                 aria-label="Bism — supported living at home"
                 poster="">
            <source src="/media/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
          <div class="hero__pull">
            <img src="/logo/bism-heart.png" alt="">
            <div class="hero__pull-quote">"Kindness in care.<br>Your voice in action."</div>
            <div class="hero__pull-label">Our promise</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== SLS / ILS SPLIT (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="split" id="services">
      <div class="split__grid">
        <div class="split__col">
          <div class="split__label">SLS — Supported Living</div>
          <h2>Your home,<br>your way.</h2>
          <p>
            Personalized support — up to 24 hours a day — delivered in the home you live in. We help with what you choose: cooking, getting to work, time with friends, the rest of life in between.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Daily living support</li>
            <li>Behavioral &amp; medical coordination</li>
            <li>Community access</li>
            <li>Roommate matching</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="split__col">
          <div class="split__label">ILS — Independent Living</div>
          <h2>Skills for<br>the long arc.</h2>
          <p>
            Coaching that meets people where they are — building real-world skills in real-world settings. We move at your speed, never ours.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Money &amp; budgeting</li>
            <li>Transportation &amp; navigation</li>
            <li>Self-advocacy</li>
            <li>Health &amp; medical management</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== APPROACH + REMAINING SECTIONS (bottom heart zone) ===================== -->
    <div class="heart-zone heart-zone--bottom">
      <div class="heart-zone__anchor heart-zone__anchor--left">
        <img class="floating-heart" src="/logo/bism-heart.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
      </div>

    <!-- ===================== APPROACH MANIFESTO (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="approach" id="approach">
      <div class="approach__grid">
        <div class="approach__side">
          <div class="eyebrow">Our approach</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>We support — <em>we don't steer.</em></h2>
          <p class="approach__lead">
            Person-centered isn't a phrase to us — it's the architecture of every plan, every pairing, every shift handoff. The person we serve is the author. We're a steady hand on the page.
          </p>
          <div class="approach__points">
            <div class="approach__point">
              <h3>Consistency over scale.</h3>
              <p>We grow slowly so DSPs stay long enough to know the people they support.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="approach__point">
              <h3>Trauma-informed, by default.</h3>
              <p>Every staff member is trained in trauma-informed care — not as a specialty, but as a baseline.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="approach__point">
              <h3>Family as partner.</h3>
              <p>We coordinate openly with families and loved ones, never around them.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="approach__point">
              <h3>Boundaries respected.</h3>
              <p>Sensory needs, communication preferences, and routines are honored without negotiation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== WHO WE SERVE (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="serve">
      <div class="serve__grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Who we serve</div>
          <h2>Adults whose stories aren't written in straight lines.</h2>
          <p>
            We serve adults (18+) who are clients of a California Regional Center — neurodivergent individuals, including those across the autism spectrum and with intellectual or developmental disabilities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="serve__row">
            <div class="serve__row-num">/01</div>
            <div class="serve__row-text">Living independently with daily support</div>
            <div class="serve__row-arrow">→</div>
          </div>
          <div class="serve__row">
            <div class="serve__row-num">/02</div>
            <div class="serve__row-text">Transitioning from a family home to their own</div>
            <div class="serve__row-arrow">→</div>
          </div>
          <div class="serve__row">
            <div class="serve__row-num">/03</div>
            <div class="serve__row-text">Moving from group living toward greater autonomy</div>
            <div class="serve__row-arrow">→</div>
          </div>
          <div class="serve__row">
            <div class="serve__row-num">/04</div>
            <div class="serve__row-text">Navigating complex needs with 24-hour care</div>
            <div class="serve__row-arrow">→</div>
          </div>
          <div class="serve__row">
            <div class="serve__row-num">/05</div>
            <div class="serve__row-text">Building skills before a planned transition</div>
            <div class="serve__row-arrow">→</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== SERVICE AREAS (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="areas" id="areas">
      <div class="areas__grid">
        <div class="areas__map">
          <img class="areas__map-image" src="/media/map.png"
               alt="Map of Los Angeles area Regional Centers — North LA County, San Gabriel/Pomona, Westside, Lanterman, Eastern LA, South Central LA, Harbor"
               loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <div class="areas__map-label">Los Angeles area Regional Centers</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Where we work</div>
          <h2>Across LA County, with roots in our home region.</h2>
          <p style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--soft-ink); max-width:440px; margin:0 0 28px;">
            Bism serves adults across Los Angeles County and welcomes inquiries from clients of any California Regional Center.
          </p>
          <div class="areas__list">
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">North Los Angeles County</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">NLACRC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">San Gabriel / Pomona</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">SGPRC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">Westside</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">WRC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">Lanterman</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">FDLRC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">Eastern Los Angeles</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">ELARC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">South Central Los Angeles</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">SCLARC</div></div>
            <div class="areas__row"><div class="areas__row-name">Harbor</div><div class="areas__row-abbr">HRC</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="areas__cities">
            <div class="areas__cities-label">Where we're deepest</div>
            <p>
              Our steadiest coverage is the Lanterman catchment — Burbank, Glendale, Hollywood,
              La Cañada Flintridge, La Crescenta-Montrose, North Hollywood, Pasadena, Sunland and Tujunga.
              We can serve adults anywhere in LA County a Regional Center authorizes services with us.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== TESTIMONIALS (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="quotes" id="testimonials">
      <div class="quotes__label">From families</div>
      <blockquote>
        "We waited a long time for the right vendor. The difference is that <em>they ask my son what he wants</em>, and they listen and help."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="quotes__attrib">David &amp; Anne K. — Parents, Long Beach</div>
      <div class="quotes__small">
        <div>
          <p>"For the first time, my brother has a morning routine. He cares to participate more."</p>
          <div class="quotes__small-name">Marisol R., Pasadena</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>"After years of replacement after replacement with other vendors, the same DSP has been with my daughter for three years. This is really, really good for her."</p>
          <div class="quotes__small-name">Linda T., West LA</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>"They taught my son to take the bus. They also taught him it's okay to ask for help."</p>
          <div class="quotes__small-name">Ahmad &amp; Sara F., Long Beach</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== CAREERS (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="careers" id="careers">
      <div class="careers__grid">
        <video class="photo photo--video careers__photo"
               data-scroll-video
               preload="auto" muted playsinline
               disablepictureinpicture
               aria-label="Bism team — staff in service">
          <source src="/media/careers.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Careers · DSP</div>
          <h2>Patient work, with people who matter.</h2>
          <p class="careers__lead">
            We hire for presence and enthusiasm, then train hard for the rest.
          </p>
          <a class="btn--accent" href="#">View open roles →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== RESOURCES (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="resources">
      <div class="resources__head">
        <div class="eyebrow">For families</div>
        <h2>Plain-language guides for the parts no one explains.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="resources__grid">
        <a class="resources__card" href="#" data-modal="modal-guide-ipp">
          <div>
            <div class="resources__card-tag">GUIDE / 01</div>
            <div class="resources__card-title">The IPP, demystified</div>
            <div class="resources__card-desc">What goes in, what comes out, and how to advocate inside it.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="resources__card-cta">Read →</div>
        </a>
        <a class="resources__card" href="#" data-modal="modal-guide-vendor">
          <div>
            <div class="resources__card-tag">GUIDE / 02</div>
            <div class="resources__card-title">Choosing a vendor</div>
            <div class="resources__card-desc">Questions worth asking before signing any service contract.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="resources__card-cta">Read →</div>
        </a>
        <a class="resources__card" href="#" data-modal="modal-guide-rc">
          <div>
            <div class="resources__card-tag">GUIDE / 03</div>
            <div class="resources__card-title">Regional Center 101</div>
            <div class="resources__card-desc">Roles, timelines, and the language of eligibility.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="resources__card-cta">Read →</div>
        </a>
        <a class="resources__card" href="#" data-modal="modal-guide-transition">
          <div>
            <div class="resources__card-tag">GUIDE / 04</div>
            <div class="resources__card-title">Planning a transition</div>
            <div class="resources__card-desc">From family home, group home, or school — what to expect.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="resources__card-cta">Read →</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== FAQ (Direction B) ===================== -->
    <section class="faq" id="faq">
      <div class="faq__grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
          <h2>Questions, answered honestly.</h2>
          <p class="faq__lead">Don't see yours? Reach out — we'd rather hear it directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__list">
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">What's the difference between SLS and ILS?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Supported Living Services (SLS) help adults live in their own homes with personalized 24/7 support tailored to their needs. Independent Living Services (ILS) teach the skills needed to live more independently — budgeting, cooking, transportation, and self-advocacy. Both are funded through California's Regional Centers.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">Who is eligible for services?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Adults (18+) who are clients of any California Regional Center with a qualifying developmental disability diagnosis. Bism is vendored with the Frank D. Lanterman Regional Center (FDLRC) as our home region, and welcomes inquiries from clients of any LA-area Regional Center — including NLACRC, ELARC, Westside, Harbor, SCLARC, and SGPRC.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">How do I get started?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Reach out to your Regional Center service coordinator and request Bism as a vendor, or contact us directly and we'll walk through the referral process with you.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">What does a typical day look like?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Every day is shaped around the person, not a schedule. Some days are quiet and routine. Others involve community outings, work, classes, or visits with family. Our role is to support — not to direct.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">Is there any cost to my family?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">No. Services written into the Individual Program Plan (IPP) are billed directly to the Regional Center. There is no out-of-pocket cost to the family or to the person receiving services.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">What languages do you speak?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Our staff speak English, Spanish, and Vietnamese, and this site is available in all three.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary class="faq__q">Are your staff trained for neurodivergent adults?<span class="faq__plus">+</span></summary>
            <div class="faq__a">Yes. All Direct Support Professionals complete onboarding in person-centered planning, positive behavior support, and trauma-informed care, with ongoing training thereafter.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
